This project is a website inspired by the Call Of Duty: Black Ops six Websites.
This project is for the Final Project in the INF 651A 2024 fall class.
You can get started with this project by downloading all files and opening index.html in a web browser.
You can get help with this project by contacting lpwinzerling@mail.fhsu.edu.
Me, La Aries Winzerling maintains and contributes to this project. 
